      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -504,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Meeting transcript to CRM\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nWhen a video call ends, the workflow fetches the transcript, matches it to the booking it belongs to, and works out whether it was a real call or a no-show.\n\nReal calls go to an AI that writes a summary, action items and the customer's pain points, which are saved to the CRM and posted to Slack.\n\nMissing transcripts and unmatched calls raise an alert instead of disappearing.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
